      "path": "cordis.patch.yml",
      "content": "# dsh-monitor bundle patch: mount the monitor tools as one row in the\n# composition. To enable in a profile, either:\n#   dsh plugin --profile <name> add dsh-monitor\n# or add \"dsh-monitor\" to the profile's dsh.profile.bundles and include this\n# file via the package's dsh.bundle.patch declaration.\n- insert:\n    - id: dsh-monitor\n      name: 'dsh-monitor'\n"
